 still very much in development, so there's much more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcoming planned features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert and frozen planet biomes, new creatures, ship requires fuel, space helmet for space mining, fertilize dirt with poop for growing crops, much more crafting, more work to the combat system and inventory, more weapon variants, more ship variants, structures on planets, overall refinement and visual improvements, updated UI, and more!     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky and unique sandbox adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently In WormWorld, you can..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Mine resources... and other things</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801040/extras/54b6a136f7907fd59c4b4138c0977ee0.poster.avif?t=1787159402\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801040/extras/54b6a136f7907fd59c4b4138c0977ee0.webm?t=1787159402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801040/extras/54b6a136f7907fd59c4b4138c0977ee0.mp4?t=1787159402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build to your hearts content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801040/extras/4bfe1721c0149624410252fa7bb19ebf.poster.avif?t=1787159402\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https