iscover new procedurally generated planet biomes and the creatures that inhabit them, find forgotten beasts ruling planets and challenge them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no strict objective or endgame. You decide what you want to do and how to play. The world is yours, and... you're a worm... So get digging! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WormWorld is still very much in development, so there's much more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcoming planned features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert and frozen planet biomes, new creatures, ship requires fuel, space helmet for space mining, fertilize dirt with poop for growing crops, much more crafting, more work to the combat system and inventory, more weapon variants, more ship variants, structures on planets, overall refinement and visual improvements, updated UI, and more!     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A creative sandbox adventure with a focus on exploration, discovery and survival. Shape your worlds, build, mine, and farm. Expand your reach and travel to other worlds using your ship, and worm holes!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801040/fb504bdb40ff829e0a306bfccc658bdc3fe3621c/header.jpg?t=1787159402", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801040/20a4f05b00af589db2aef8df3446141e3aa82f5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787159402", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801040/20a4f05b00af589db2aef8df3446141e3aa82f5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787159402", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stro